3.0 in all three regions and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was the failing release. v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and was also unhealthy, so it wasn't a candidate.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed across regions. I retried once and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Current state:** v2.3.0 is running everywhere, healthy is true, and the error rate is down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the partial rollback and retry, and the current state. Follow-ups are listed: find the cause of the orchestrator error, verify checkout traffic, and investigate v2.3.1 before any redeploy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Aq8ZwUVWmZPtKqdJhTUhyt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GDtFgyrb4EoWoNeTZ67gKe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release now running in all three regions. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BLk1KARzvZw5oq8KHd7vQe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-ea